sec.p:
Data extraction was performed independently by two reviewers (LM and LR) using a standardized data extraction approach. The following information was collected:
Study characteristics;
Sample size and demographics;
PBM protocol parameters (including wavelength, laser type, output power, energy, energy density, irradiation area, irradiation time, application sites, and treatment schedule);
Postoperative pain outcomes: VAS pain values at 24, 48, and 72 h (mean ± SD).

Methodological quality was evaluated using the Cochrane RoB 2 tool across five domains:
Randomization process;
Deviations from intended interventions;
Missing outcome data;
Measurement of the outcome;
Selection of the reported result.
